<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Thank you so much for taking the time to contact us about your recent flight.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2" style="">We want your journey to be as simple and seamless as possible, so it was concerning to hear about your experience with the Qantas Valet<i style=""> </i><b style=""><i>-staff/facilities-</i></b><i style=""> </i>in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}. You should receive professional, courteous and helpful service from all of our team and very disappointed to learn about the attitude of the team member you encountered there.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" style=""><font face="arial">I would like to assure you that your experience was not the service we strive to deliver.&nbsp; So that we can learn from your feedback, I have forwarded a copy of your experience to our Airport Management in&nbsp;{!Case.Departure_Airport__c}.&nbsp;</font></font><font face="arial" size="2">Your comments will be used to improve the performance of the staff concerned.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><i><font size="2">-If requesting follow up add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">However, as I’m sure you can appreciate, I cannot advise you of any internal investigation or discipline outcomes due to privacy legislation.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">I’m grateful for you taking the time to get in touch with us about this, and I hope that we can welcome you on board again soon.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>